          "description": "PURPOSE: Read an unsigned 16-bit big-endian value from PowerPC memory at the given absolute address. USAGE: For 16-bit fields — HP, score, coordinates on many GC/Wii titles. For single bytes use dolphin_read8; for 32/64-bit use dolphin_read32/read64. Value is interpreted big-endian (PowerPC native); the byte at",
